<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures trade quietly.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures trade quietly.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures again traded quietly on Thursday with only two months trading.</p>
<p>January 1998 futures fell 50 cents to A$166.50 a tonne on a volume of eight lots while the March 1998 contract edged up 50 cents to A$169.00 on a volume of just two lots.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the other contracts were mostly unchanged.</p>
